# Marker file only — do not delete.
#
# Maven's launcher walks up from the invocation directory looking for a `.mvn`
# directory and sets `maven.multiModuleProjectDirectory` to its parent. The root
# pom.xml uses that property to locate `config/checkstyle/*` and
# `config/spotbugs/*`, so without this anchor those paths resolve relative to
# whichever submodule directory `mvn` was invoked from and the build fails with
# "Unable to find suppressions file at location: <module>/config/checkstyle/...".
#
# Verify with: cd <any-submodule> && mvn -o -B checkstyle:check
